# =============================================================================
#  SRS.orch - Speech Restoration System (CAE-USC V2.5)
#  Workflow Description Language v0.3, AIF V3.0
#
#  One Controller, one Module, which executes by exchange: the four inputs are given,
#  then the Restored Segment is asked for. The User Agent gets each datum from where
#  its App says (the labels are the App's to answer):
#
#    "Voice"       the Speech Segments for Modelling: speech of the speaker, to make the
#                  model of the voice from
#    "Texts"       the texts of the damaged sections, in order
#    "Damaged"     the speech that is damaged
#    "DamagedList" where it is damaged
#
#  and presents what the Module gives:
#
#    Restored      the Damaged Segment with the damaged sections replaced by speech
#                  synthesised in the voice of the speaker
# =============================================================================

workflow SRS over 1CAE-SRS-V2.5-I01

on Start:

    ask Controller to start

    offer   Voice       (OSD-BSO-V1.5:1) from device "Voice"
    offer   Texts       (OSD-BTO-V1.5)   from device "Texts"
    offer   Damaged     (OSD-BSO-V1.5:2) from device "Damaged"
    offer   DamagedList (CAE-DLS-V2.5)   from device "DamagedList"
    ask     Restored    (OSD-BSO-V1.5)
    present Restored

on Stop:
    ask Controller to stop